  unitName: Aqua Goddess Kuhla
  unitId: 20485
  unitNumber: 686
  description: A sorceress who betrayed the human race to join the God Army. Though
    she had been part of Sama's Imperial Army, she suddenly fled, later appearing
    amidst the gods' troops which where attacking Atharva. The reason for her betrayal
    is unknown, and though many theories have come about, no valid reasons for her
    actions have been found thus far. Towards the end of the war, Eze, one of the
    Six Heroes appeared before her. It is said that Eze got no reaction from Kuhla
    after approaching her, but that she just proceeded to fiercely spread carnage.
  summonDesc: Talking with you<br>reminds me of him...
  fusionDesc: Yes, I got stronger...<br>Thanks...
  evoDesc: Fine...<br>I trust you somewhat...
  element: 2
  rarity: 5
